<title>USA: Sylvan Learning sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Sylvan Learning sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sylvan Learning Systems Inc said on Monday it authorized a three-for-two common stock split, effective in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend would be distibuted on November 7 to shareholders of record at the close of business at October 7, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
